'''Deathrock''' (デスロック, ''Desu Rokku'', '''Death Rock''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

==Effect==
Cannon Start Level UP (Sm): Cannon gauge will be filled +2 steps/20% charged.

